{"id":"629524","name":"槐花馒头","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629524/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"槐花","amount":"400g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"1200g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温水里放酵母溶化。","img":"images/629524/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放面粉。","img":"images/629524/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成面团放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/629524/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发好的面。","img":"images/629524/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"邻居给的焯过水槐花，撰干水分放热锅里。","img":"images/629524/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒至温热。","img":"images/629524/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放发好的面团里。","img":"images/629524/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉光。","img":"images/629524/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揪成剂子。","img":"images/629524/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉成馒头。","img":"images/629524/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"二次发酵好。","img":"images/629524/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"入蒸锅，大火烧开，改中火蒸25分钟关火焖5分钟。","img":"images/629524/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蒸好的馒头。","img":"images/629524/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629524/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}